      "qualityReason": "editorial_filler"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Maryland comptroller’s office reported in March 2025 that permitting and legal fees for the Purple Line had ballooned from an original $6 million budget to roughly $800 million, largely due to lawsuits and contract renegotiations.",
